---
---

<section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 pt-28 pb-24 border-b border-hairline">
	<p class="kicker text-[12px] font-semibold text-accent uppercase mb-6">
		Write once. Publish everywhere.
	</p>
	<h1 class="text-[2.4rem] sm:text-[3.4rem] leading-[1.1] sm:leading-[1.05] font-semibold tracking-tight max-w-3xl">
		技術記事のための、<br />Publishing infrastructure。
	</h1>
	<p class="mt-7 text-[17px] text-neutral-500 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
		DevCastは記事を一元管理し、Qiita・DEV Community・はてなブログへ同時配信するHeadless
		CMS。更新も同期状態も、自動で把握できます。
	</p>
	<div class="mt-10 flex items-center gap-4">
		<a
			href="https://app.devcast.work/signup"
			class="bg-neutral-900 text-white text-sm font-medium px-6 py-3 rounded-md hover:bg-neutral-700 transition"
		>
			GitHubで始める
		</a>
		<a href="https://docs.devcast.work" class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-600 hover:text-neutral-900 flex items-center gap-1">
			View docs <span>→</span>
		</a>
	</div>

	<div class="mt-20 border border-hairline rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2">
			<div class="p-8 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-hairline">
				<p class="text-[11px] kicker text-neutral-400 uppercase mb-4">Article</p>
				<p class="font-semibold mb-1">WebMCPを実装して分かったこと</p>
				<p class="text-sm text-neutral-400 mb-6">revision 18 · updated 2 hours ago</p>
				<div class="font-mono text-[13px] text-neutral-500 leading-6 bg-neutral-50 rounded-md p-4">
					# WebMCPを実装して分かったこと<br />
					<span class="text-neutral-400">tags: webmcp, mcp</span>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="p-8">
				<p class="text-[11px] kicker text-neutral-400 uppercase mb-4">Publication status</p>
				<div class="space-y-3 font-mono text-[13px]">
					<div class="flex justify-between items-center">
						<span>Qiita</span><span class="text-emerald-600">✔ Latest</span>
					</div>
					<div class="flex justify-between items-center">
						<span>DEV.to</span><span class="text-emerald-600">✔ Latest</span>
					</div>
					<div class="flex justify-between items-center">
						<span>はてなブログ</span><span class="text-accent">⚠ Update available</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
